  "description": "Speed Boom: Last Delivery is a high-speed arcade experience built around one thing — momentum.\n\nDash across a vibrant neon city, wall-run between skyscrapers, chain jumps across rooftops, and deliver packages as fast as humanly possible. Every second counts. Every shortcut matters. Every mistake costs you time.\n\nTake on 40 time-based deliveries and push for the ultimate S+ rank. The faster you move, the better the reward. Master the routes, optimize your path, and chase your personal best.\n\nEarn coins through perfect runs and exploration. Upgrade your runner’s speed, acceleration, and movement to break your limits. Unlock a variety of skins and express your style while dominating the streets.\n\nThe city is fully explorable and packed with hidden graffiti waiting to be discovered. Find them, repaint them with your own mark, and turn the streets into your playground.\n\nDesigned for replayability and built with flow in mind, Speed Boom: Last Delivery is speedrun-friendly and rewards skill, precision, and mastery.\n\nNo brakes. No limits. Just speed.",
